1. **Check Delivery Status**: Look for any tracking information provided by the delivery service or retailer. This may give you details about the delivery attempt.

2. **Contact the Delivery Service**: Reach out to the delivery company (e.g., UPS, FedEx, USPS) to inquire about rescheduling the delivery or picking it up at a local facility.

