5. **Set Up a Redelivery**: Many delivery services allow you to schedule a redelivery online. Check their website for options.

6. **Consider Alternative Delivery Options**: If available, you might be able to have your package delivered to a different address, such as a neighbor or a local pickup location.

7. **Be Available for Future Deliveries**: If you know the delivery is coming again, try to be available during the expected delivery window.

